0..53 Comment "//! Law 3 moves a lifted substitution past weakening."
54..57 Comment "//!"
58..115 Comment "//! `sub(sub(b, p), lift(s))` equals `sub(sub(b, s), p)`."
116..119 Comment "//!"
120..196 Comment "//! The law does not hold by direct computation. The substitution stops at a"
197..273 Comment "//! variable `b`. An induction on `b` proves the law. `substSquare` takes it"
274..334 Comment "//! from the agreement of the two composites at every index."
335..338 Comment "//!"
339..354 Comment "//! - see: #640"
356..407 Comment "// This source imports syntax and weakening lemmas."
